lay it safe. You need only one extra trick and you can take it by playing the @HA "],["pg",""],["lc","ha"],["pc","ha"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hc","hq"],["at","and then the @HQ "],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["pc","hq"],["hc","hk"],["at","to drive out the opponents' @HK "],["pg",""],["lc","hk"],["pc","hk"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hc","hj"],["at","thereby promoting your @HJ into a winner. There is no need to risk your contract by taking a Heart finesse."],["",""]]}}